# These are rules about rules: creating, editing, updating

- The cursor rules director is in the root at .cursor/rules/
- Each cursor rules file has a descriptive name and a descriptive first title
- Each cursor rules file ends with .mdc
- You SHOULD:
    - frequently reference cursor rules files
    - frequently update any cursor rules files that have the `// UPDATES: ON` parameter set
    - when needed, create new cursor rules files, mostly when requested to
- You SHOULD NOT:
    - delete cursor rules files
    - delete any specific rules within files that i did not instruct you to delete
    - add any specific rules within files that i did not instruct you to add
